{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doodle Drive \u2013 Where Creativity Meets Physics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Doodle Drive</strong>, every level is a canvas, and your imagination is the key to success! Use your creativity to draw roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car through a series of challenging puzzles. Navigate tricky terrain, collect stars, and drive your way to victory in this fun, physics-based adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw Mode:</strong>\u00a0Use your ink to create roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive Mode:</strong>\u00a0Test your creations by driving the car along your path and collecting stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.poster.avif?t=1746878855\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.webm?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.mp4?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw Your Own Path</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sketch custom roads and physics shapes to create the perfect route for your car to navigate each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Unique Cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 different cars, each with its own driving style and abilities. Pick the right one for each challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 Handcrafted Levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of meticulously designed levels that will put your creativity and problem-solving skills to the test.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Physics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic physics as your car and doodles interact with the environment, making every run feel unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Creativity</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles in your own way \u2013 no two solutions are ever the same. The more inventive you are, the better your chances of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/3d3c5e9bb672253a3a605cd390837b90.avif?t=1746878855\" width=630 height=175 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draw smart. Drive fast. Expect a few flips along the way.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2011190?t=1746878855","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746878855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746878855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746878855","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doodle Drive \u2013 Where Creativity Meets Physics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Doodle Drive</strong>, every level is a canvas, and your imagination is the key to success! Use your creativity to draw roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car through a series of challenging puzzles. Navigate tricky terrain, collect stars, and drive your way to victory in this fun, physics-based adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw Mode:</strong>\u00a0Use your ink to create roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive Mode:</strong>\u00a0Test your creations by driving the car along your path and collecting stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.poster.avif?t=1746878855\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.webm?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.mp4?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw Your Own Path</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sketch custom roads and physics shapes to create the perfect route for your car to navigate each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Unique Cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 different cars, each with its own driving style and abilities. Pick the right one for each challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 Handcrafted Levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of meticulously designed levels that will put your creativity and problem-solving skills to the test.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Physics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic physics as your car and doodles interact with the environment, making every run feel unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Creativity</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles in your own way \u2013 no two solutions are ever the same. The more inventive you are, the better your chances of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/3d3c5e9bb672253a3a605cd390837b90.avif?t=1746878855\" width=630 height=175 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draw smart. Drive fast. Expect a few flips along the way.</strong></h2>","developers":["Slow Development"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/header.jpg?t=1746878855","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2011190/480000/e8311eb5ee6c045c4694a415d49281f2ad5af23e/1751067262/dash_av1.mpd?t=1660931198","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2011190/480000/e8311eb5ee6c045c4694a415d49281f2ad5af23e/1751067262/dash_h264.mpd?t=1660931198","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2011190/480000/e8311eb5ee6c04